msgctxt "72N7d0"
msgid "In a pasture, grass is eaten by grasshoppers, grasshoppers by frogs and frogs by snakes."
msgstr "Dans une prairie, les sauterelles mangent l’herbe, les grenouilles mangent les sauterelles et les serpents mangent les grenouilles."

